# Google OAuth client id for the extension (Chrome App type, registered against the extension id that the
# manifest `key` pins: jagkpbdiempedibinmfafamdhnogognn). Read at BUILD time by wxt.config.ts into
# manifest.oauth2.client_id. Leave it unset and the panel says "Drive not configured": Google sign-in is
# hidden and the vault falls back to brain storage, which is a complete path (judges / CI need nothing here).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Copy to .env (never commit .env). The matching brain-side variable, for the optional Google ID-token auth,
# is GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID on the Cloud Run service (backend/dayflow/api/auth.py).
